HTTPS
Hypertext Transfer Protocol(Secure) is a stateless client-server protocol used for the World Wide Web. This means that each request is processed indenpendently, without the server retaining information about previos request.
Protocol itself is stateless, modern websites and web applications implements mechanism to introduce statefulness at the application level.
statefulness refers to the ability of a system to remember previous interactions or states, this work generating a session identifier, which is commonly stored in a cookie or token.
